    "headingUrdu": "گیسوں کی منتقلی کا طریقہ",
    "headingPashto": "د ګازونو د لېږد میکانیزم",
    "urduTitle": "گیسوں کی منتقلی کا طریقہ",
    "text": "Like other materials, respiratory gases are also transported in various regions of the body by means of blood. The blood transports oxygen from the lungs to different tissues and carbon dioxides from tissues to the lungs.",
