    "diagramSvg": "<figure class=\"bio12-coded-figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 610 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Fig: 15.1 Mechanism of homeostasis.\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"610\" height=\"250\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"90.0\" y2=\"59.0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"90,66 93.8,59.0 86.2,59.0\" fill=\"#334155\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"68\" width=\"130\" height=\"62\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fed7aa\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" /><rect x=\"200\" y=\"68\" width=\"130\" height=\"62\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fed7aa\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" /><rect x=\"360\" y=\"68\" width=\"120\" height=\"62\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fed7aa\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" /><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"99\" x2=\"191.0\" y2=\"99.0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"198,99 191.0,95.2 191.0,102.8\" fill=\"#334155\"/><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"99\" x2=\"351.0\" y2=\"99.0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"358,99 351.0,95.2 351.0,102.8\" fill=\"#334155\"/><path d=\"M545 82 L 545 220 L 20 220 L 20 99 L 38 99\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"99\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"99.0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><polygon points=\"40,99 34.0,95.7 34.0,102.3\" fill=\"#475569\"/><line x1=\"540\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"492.0\" y2=\"84.0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><polygon points=\"486,84 492.0,87.3 492.0,80.7\" fill=\"#475569\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11.0px;font-weight:700;\">Stimulus (input into the system)</text><text x=\"105.0\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;font-weight:700;\">RECEPTOR</text><text x=\"105.0\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;\">(e.g. free nerve</text><text x=\"105.0\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;\">ending in the skin)</text><text x=\"265.0\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;font-weight:700;\">INTEGRATOR</text><text x=\"265.0\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;\">(such as the brain)</text><text x=\"420.0\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;font-weight:700;\">EFFECTORS</text><text x=\"420.0\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;\">(a muscle or</text><text x=\"420.0\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;\">a gland)</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;font-weight:700;\">RESPONSE</text><text x=\"486\" y=\"74\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;font-weight:700;\">(system&#x27;s output)</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;font-weight:700;\">The response to the stimulus leads to change.</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"167\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;font-weight:700;\">The change is fed back to the receptor.</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;font-weight:700;\">In negative feedback, the response of the system</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"197\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0px;font-weight:700;\">cancels or counteracts the effect of the original stimulus.</text></svg><figcaption>Fig: 15.1 Mechanism of homeostasis.</figcaption></figure>",
