    "headingPashto": "لاملونه",
    "urduTitle": "اسباب",
    "text": "The bacterial and fungal strains that cause most common type of UTIs include:\n\nEscherichia coli\nStaphylococcus saprophyticus\nKlebsiella, Enterococci bacteria, and Proteus mirabilis\nFungal organisms, such as Candida albicans that also causes the infections in mouth, digestive tract, and vagina.)",
