     "title": "Draw a diagram of sarcomere and label its parts.",
     "desc": "<p><strong>SpaceBook learning answer:</strong> Draw two Z lines, thin actin filaments attached to each, and central thick myosin filaments. Label the sarcomere, A band, I bands, H zone, M line and the overlap region. The relaxed/contracted schematic in long answer vi provides a starting layout.</p>",
