    "heading": "17.8 NERVOUS DISORDERS AND DIAGNOSTIC TESTS",
    "title": "17.8 NERVOUS DISORDERS AND DIAGNOSTIC TESTS",
    "headingUrdu": "عصبی عوارض اور تشخیصی ٹیسٹ",
