    "diagramSvg": "<figure class=\"bio12-coded-figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 350 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ACT F.A.S.T!\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"350\" height=\"230\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"342\" height=\"222\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" /><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"346\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"66\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"1\" /><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"346\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"112\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"1\" /><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"346\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"158\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"1\" /><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"346\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"204\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"1\" /><text x=\"175\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15.0px;font-weight:700;\">ACT F.A.S.T!</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:9.0px;font-weight:700;\">FACE: Does one side of the face drop?</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:9.0px;font-weight:700;\">ARMS: Is one arm weak or</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:9.0px;font-weight:700;\">numb and does one drifts downward?</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:9.0px;font-weight:700;\">SPEECH: Is speech slurred? Ask the</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"167\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:9.0px;font-weight:700;\">person to repeat a simple sentence.</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:9.0px;font-weight:700;\">TIME: If the person shows any of these symptoms,</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"213\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:9.0px;font-weight:700;\">call emergency services or get to the hospital immediately.</text></svg></figure>",
