     "Printed numbering jumps from 18.2 to 18.2.2 (no 18.2.1 printed); preserved. Printed \"Luteinizing hormome\" and \"the luteinization i.e.\" preserved. Figs 18.2 a/b are photographs in print; recreated as coded illustrations."
