     "Printed headings \"23.3.3\" and \"23.3.5\" (for 21.3.3, 21.3.5), \"called a multiple fetuses\", \"healthy babies born\" and \"birth occurs .The\" preserved. Figs 21.8-21.12 are photographs; recreated as coded illustrations."
