      "svgUrdu": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Fig: 24.6 Darwin&#x27;s voyage (1831-1836) proceeded from England to the coast of South America, across the pacific to Australia and back around the South Africa to England.\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"520\" height=\"240\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"512\" height=\"232\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#bae6fd\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" /><path d=\"M60 40 L 150 30 L 170 80 L 130 110 L 90 90 Z\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" /><path d=\"M140 120 L 175 120 L 190 160 L 160 220 L 145 180 Z\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" /><path d=\"M230 40 L 300 30 L 330 60 L 290 80 L 250 70 Z\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" /><path d=\"M250 90 L 300 90 L 310 150 L 280 190 L 260 150 Z\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" /><path d=\"M330 40 L 460 30 L 470 90 L 400 110 L 340 80 Z\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" /><path d=\"M420 160 L 480 160 L 470 200 L 425 195 Z\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" /><path d=\"M255 55 L225 95 L205 140 L190 175 L160 215 L120 150 L100 120 L60 140 L200 200 L380 190 L455 175 L470 205 L360 150 L300 205 L260 170 L210 120 L240 70 L255 55\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"60\"y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:'Jameel Noori Nastaleeq','Noto Nastaliq Urdu','Noto Naskh Arabic',serif;font-size:8.6px;font-weight:700;\" unicode-bidi=\"isolate\">گالاپاگوس جزائر</text><text x=\"80\"y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:'Jameel Noori Nastaleeq','Noto Nastaliq Urdu','Noto Naskh Arabic',serif;font-size:8.6px;font-weight:700;\" unicode-bidi=\"isolate\">شمالی بحرالکاہل</text><text x=\"210\"y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:'Jameel Noori Nastaleeq','Noto Nastaliq Urdu','Noto Naskh Arabic',serif;font-size:8.6px;font-weight:700;\" unicode-bidi=\"isolate\">شمالی بحرِ اوقیانوس</text><text x=\"240\"y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:'Jameel Noori Nastaleeq','Noto Nastaliq Urdu','Noto Naskh Arabic',serif;font-size:8.6px;font-weight:700;\" unicode-bidi=\"isolate\">کینری جزائر</text><text x=\"60\"y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:'Jameel Noori Nastaleeq','Noto Nastaliq Urdu','Noto Naskh Arabic',serif;font-size:8.6px;font-weight:700;\" unicode-bidi=\"isolate\">جنوبی بحرالکاہل</text><text x=\"215\"y=\"175\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:'Jameel Noori Nastaleeq','Noto Nastaliq Urdu','Noto Naskh Arabic',serif;font-size:8.6px;font-weight:700;\" unicode-bidi=\"isolate\">جنوبی بحرِ اوقیانوس</text><text x=\"150\"y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:'Jameel Noori Nastaleeq','Noto Nastaliq Urdu','Noto Naskh Arabic',serif;font-size:8.6px;font-weight:700;\" unicode-bidi=\"isolate\">پورٹ ڈیزائر، فاک لینڈ جزائر</text><text x=\"370\"y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:'Jameel Noori Nastaleeq','Noto Nastaliq Urdu','Noto Naskh Arabic',serif;font-size:8.6px;font-weight:700;\" unicode-bidi=\"isolate\">بحرِ ہند</text><text x=\"345\"y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:'Jameel Noori Nastaleeq','Noto Nastaliq Urdu','Noto Naskh Arabic',serif;font-size:8.6px;font-weight:700;\" unicode-bidi=\"isolate\">مڈغاسکر، ماریشس</text><text x=\"480\"y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:'Jameel Noori Nastaleeq','Noto Nastaliq Urdu','Noto Naskh Arabic',serif;font-size:8.6px;font-weight:700;\" unicode-bidi=\"isolate\">سڈنی</text><text x=\"470\"y=\"222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#111827\" style=\"font-family:'Jameel Noori Nastaleeq','Noto Nastaliq Urdu','Noto Naskh Arabic',serif;font-size:8.6px;font-weight:700;\" unicode-bidi=\"isolate\">ہوبارٹ، تسمانیہ</text></svg>",
